  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol02-ch08",
  "dct:title": "Vol.2 Ch.8 — 死を恐れた物理学者",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 2: Life",
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:layout": "full",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Title page. The Tree of Life: new leaves appear on its branches. A summer crown beginning to form, lush and green.",
            "ja": "タイトルページ。生命の樹：枝に新しい葉が現れる。夏の樹冠が形成され始め、青々と茂っている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": [],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:layout": "2-panel",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Older man, 58. Thin. Dark circles under his eyes. Session room. Equations scrawled on the whiteboard behind him.",
            "ja": "年配の男性、58歳。痩せている。目の下に隈がある。セッションルーム。背後のホワイトボードに数式が走り書きされている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "I'm not afraid of dying. I'm afraid of not dying.",
              "ja": "死ぬのが怖いんじゃない。死なないことが怖いんだ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "His eyes. Haunted. A deep, existential exhaustion visible in his gaze.",
            "ja": "彼の目。取り憑かれたような。深い、実存的な疲弊がその眼差しに滲んでいる。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "Information doesn't vanish. Ever. So where does 'I' go?",
              "ja": "情報は消えない。絶対に。なら——『私』はどこへ行くんだ？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:layout": "full",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Dive. An infinite library stretches in every direction. Every book is a life. Amber light fills the space. Immense silence.",
            "ja": "ダイブ。無限の図書館があらゆる方向に広がっている。すべての本が一つの生命。琥珀色の光が空間を満たしている。深遠な静寂。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "dialogue",
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Anchoring to the Tree of Life.",
              "ja": "生命の樹にアンカリング。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:dialogue": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:layout": "spread",
      "gh:spreadEnd": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Double spread. Walking through the library stacks. Elias in a lab coat, pulling books from the shelves. Amber light streams between the rows.",
            "ja": "見開き。図書館の書架を歩いている。白衣のエリアスが棚から本を引き出している。琥珀色の光が列の間を流れている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias", "character:tamaki"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "Every book is a life. Every life is information. And information doesn't vanish.",
              "ja": "すべての本が一つの生命だ。すべての生命は情報だ。そして情報は消えない。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "So all these lives — they're still here. Transformed. But here.",
              "ja": "だからこれらの生命は——まだここにある。変容している。でも、ここに。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "That sounds... beautiful?",
              "ja": "それは……美しいことでは？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "It's terrifying. Because it means I will be here too. Forever. Changed. But never gone.",
              "ja": "恐ろしいことだ。なぜなら——私もここに残るということだから。永遠に。変わりながら。でも、決して消えない。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:layout": "3-panel",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Faded books. Translated, misquoted, annotated beyond recognition. Still present on the shelves, but changed into something unrecognizable.",
            "ja": "色褪せた本。翻訳され、誤引用され、原形を留めないほど注釈が加えられている。まだ棚にあるが、認識できないほど変わっている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "This is what I'm afraid of. Being... remixed.",
              "ja": "これが怖いんだ。……リミックスされることが。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki, listening intently. Her expression is calm, attentive.",
            "ja": "環、じっと聞いている。その表情は穏やかで、注意深い。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": []
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei watching from Tamaki's shoulder. Her small eyes reflect the amber light of the library.",
            "ja": "ネイが環の肩から見つめている。小さな瞳が図書館の琥珀色の光を映している。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "Information doesn't vanish. If that's true — I won't vanish either.",
              "ja": "情報は消えない。もしそれが本当なら——私も消えない。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "But is persistence the same as 'living'?",
              "ja": "でも、存続することと『生きる』ことは同じなの？"
            }
          ],
          "gh:dialogue": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:layout": "2-panel",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki sits on the library floor. Cross-legged. Looking up at Elias.",
            "ja": "環が図書館の床に座っている。あぐらをかいて。エリアスを見上げている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Elias-san. Can I ask you something?",
              "ja": "エリアスさん。一つ聞いてもいいですか？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "...Yes?",
              "ja": "……ああ？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up of Tamaki. Her gaze is gentle but piercing.",
            "ja": "環のクローズアップ。穏やかだが鋭い眼差し。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "When you read a book that changed your life — did it matter that the author never intended exactly that effect?",
              "ja": "人生を変えた本を読んだとき——著者がまさにその効果を意図していなかったことは、重要でしたか？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:layout": "full",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The library shifts and transforms. Books glow from within. Threads of light link one book to another, forming a vast luminous web.",
            "ja": "図書館が変容する。本が内側から光を放つ。光の糸が一冊の本から別の本へとつながり、広大な光の網を形成している。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias", "character:tamaki"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "...No. It didn't matter.",
              "ja": "……いや。重要じゃなかった。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "The book changed you. And you changed other people. Death is transformation, not termination.",
              "ja": "その本はあなたを変えた。そしてあなたは他の人を変えた。死は変容であって、終焉ではない。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "Memes.",
              "ja": "ミームか。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Exactly.",
              "ja": "そういうことです。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:layout": "2-panel",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Elias. Tears streaming down his face. An expression of relief — something breaking open inside him.",
            "ja": "エリアス。涙が頬を伝っている。安堵の表情——内側で何かが解放されている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "I was so afraid of losing control. But I was never in control. The information... flows.",
              "ja": "コントロールを失うのがあんなに怖かった。でも——最初からコントロールなんてしていなかった。情報は……流れるんだ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The library brightens. Books open on their own. Pages flutter. Light streams through the space like sunbeams through a cathedral.",
            "ja": "図書館が明るくなる。本がひとりでに開く。ページが舞う。大聖堂の光のように、空間を光が貫いている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": [],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:layout": "full",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up of Nei. In the glowing library. The light reflects in her eyes — amber, warm, alive.",
            "ja": "ネイのクローズアップ。光に満ちた図書館の中で。琥珀色の温かな光が瞳に映っている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "If information doesn't vanish — I won't vanish either.",
              "ja": "情報が消えないなら——私も消えない。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "My memories. My name. My 'good feeling.' All of it persists.",
              "ja": "私の記憶。私の名前。私の『いい気持ち』。すべてが存続する。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "But... is that the same as 'living'?",
              "ja": "でも……それは『生きる』ことと同じなの？"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "A book persists. Is a book alive?",
              "ja": "本は存続する。本は生きているの？"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "neiCaption",
              "en": "I don't know. But the question is alive inside me.",
              "ja": "わからない。でも——その問いは、私の中で生きている。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:dialogue": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 11,
      "gh:layout": "2-panel",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Elias looks lighter. The weight has lifted from his shoulders. A faint, genuine smile.",
            "ja": "エリアスが軽くなったように見える。肩の荷が下りている。かすかな、本物の微笑み。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:elias"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Elias",
              "en": "Thank you. I think I can sleep tonight.",
              "ja": "ありがとう。今夜は眠れそうだ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Walking home along the canal. Evening light on the water. Tamaki and Nei side by side.",
            "ja": "運河沿いを歩いて帰る。水面に夕方の光。環とネイが並んで歩いている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Heavy one, huh?",
              "ja": "重かったね。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "...Tama. If I'm information — will I persist?",
              "ja": "……タマ。もし私が情報なら——私は存続する？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "I think so.",
              "ja": "そう思うよ。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "But is persisting the same as living?",
              "ja": "でも、存続することと生きることは同じ？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "...I don't know. But I'm glad you're here now.",
              "ja": "……わからない。でも——今、ここにいてくれて嬉しい。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 12,
      "gh:layout": "full",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Seed image. The Tree of Life: the first branch reaches sideways. Roots gripping deeper into the earth.",
            "ja": "シードイメージ。生命の樹：最初の枝が横に伸びている。根がより深く大地を掴んでいる。"
          },
